1
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:15,000
What if every moment in life came with a second chance?

2
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:24,000
About Time is a drama, romance, fantasy film directed by Richard Curtis.

3
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:33,000
The night after another unsatisfactory New Year's party, Tim's father tells his son that
the men in his family have always had the ability to travel through time.

4
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:42,000
They can't change history, but they can change what
happens and has happened in their own lives.

5
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:51,000
Thus begins the start of a lesson in learning to appreciate life itself as it is,
as it comes, and most importantly, the people living alongside us.

6
00:36:54,000 --> 00:37:00,000
Tim Lake, played by Domhnall Gleeson.

7
00:43:03,000 --> 00:43:09,000
Mary, played by Rachel McAdams.

8
00:49:12,000 --> 00:49:18,000
Dad, played by Bill Nighy.

9
00:55:21,000 --> 00:55:27,000
Harry, played by Tom Hollander.

10
01:01:30,000 --> 01:01:36,000
Charlotte, played by Margot Robbie.

11
01:07:39,000 --> 01:07:45,000
Kit Kat, played by Lydia Wilson.

12
01:13:48,000 --> 01:13:54,000
About Time is a 2013 romantic science fiction comedy-drama film written and directed by
Richard Curtis, and starring Domhnall Gleeson, Rachel McAdams, and Bill Nighy.

13
01:19:57,000 --> 01:20:03,000
The film is about a young man with the ability to time travel who tries
to change his past in hopes of improving his future.

14
01:26:06,000 --> 01:26:12,000
The film was released in the United Kingdom on 4 September 2013.

15
01:32:15,000 --> 01:32:21,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics.

16
01:38:24,000 --> 01:38:30,000
At the box office, it grossed $87.1 million against a $12 million budget.

17
01:44:33,000 --> 01:44:39,000
It was dedicated to actor Richard Griffiths, who died a few months before
the film's release, marking his final film appearance.

18
01:50:42,000 --> 01:50:48,000
The film explores themes of london, england, soulmates, parent
child relationship, time travel, family secrets.

19
01:56:51,000 --> 01:56:57,000
The tone is lighthearted and uplifting and emotional.
